 "remarks": "HIGHEST AND BEST: Please submit your offer by Monday Aug. 3 at 2:00. Desirable end-unit 2-bedroom townhouse with a full basement in the sought-after Westnor complex! Nestled at the end of a cul-de-sac in a picturesque, park-like setting, this welcoming community offers a pool, playground, and basketball area for residents to enjoy. The home features a private entrance and a spacious, light-filled living room that flows seamlessly into the dining area and kitchen, creating a comfortable space for everyday living and entertaining. Sliding glass doors open to a private porch and patio, conveniently located just steps from the community pool. Both bedrooms are generously sized and offer ample closet space. The full, partially finished basement provides excellent flexibility for additional living space, whether you envision a media room, home office, fitness area, or playroom. A large laundry and storage room adds even more functionality. Enjoy the perfect balance of privacy and convenience in this tucked-away neighborhood setting, while remaining close to shopping, dining, and transportation. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy comfortable townhouse living in a highly desirable location. Subject to seller securing suitable housing (property already identified).",
